{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13786","headline":"奉酬茅山赠赐幷简綦毋正字 · 顾况","name":"奉酬茅山赠赐幷简綦毋正字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉帝居金阙，灵山几处朝。\n简书犹有畏，神理讵能超。\n鹤庙新家近，龙门旧国遥。\n离怀结不断，玉洞一吹箫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13786.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13786","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}